{"author":["Elastic"],"description":"检测经26端口向互联网发送SMTP。对应需求：命令控制。官方：SMTP to the Internet on Port 26/TCP。","false_positives":["合法变更窗口内的运维、发布或安全扫描"],"from":"now-9m","index":["logs-network_traffic.*","logs-panw.panos*","logs-fortinet_fortigate.log-*","logs-pfsense.log-*","logs-zeek.*","logs-corelight.*"],"language":"kuery","license":"Elastic License v2","name":"【默认】经26端口向互联网发送SMTP","references":["https://unit42.paloaltonetworks.com/unit42-badpatch/","https://isc.sans.edu/forums/diary/Next+up+whats+up+with+TCP+port+26/25564/"],"risk_score":21,"rule_id":"d7e62693-aab9-4f66-a21a-3d79ecdd603d","severity":"low","tags":["操作系统: 网络","主题: 命令控制","来源: 默认","对应需求: 命令控制"],"timestamp_override":"event.ingested","type":"query","query":"(data_stream.dataset: (fortinet_fortigate.log or network_traffic.flow or zeek.smtp) or event.category:(network or network_traffic)) and\n  network.transport:tcp and destination.port:26 and\n  source.ip:(10.0.0.0/8 or 172.16.0.0/12 or 192.168.0.0/16) and\n  not destination.ip:(10.0.0.0/8\n    or 100.64.0.0/10\n    or 127.0.0.0/8\n    or 169.254.0.0/16\n    or 172.16.0.0/12\n    or 192.0.0.0/24\n    or 192.0.0.0/29\n    or 192.0.0.10/32\n    or 192.0.0.170/32\n    or 192.0.0.171/32\n    or 192.0.0.8/32\n    or 192.0.0.9/32\n    or 192.0.2.0/24\n    or 192.168.0.0/16\n    or 192.175.48.0/24\n    or 192.31.196.0/24\n    or 192.52.193.0/24\n    or 192.88.99.0/24\n    or 198.18.0.0/15\n    or 198.51.100.0/24\n    or 203.0.113.0/24\n    or 224.0.0.0/4\n    or 240.0.0.0/4\n    or \"::1\"\n    or \"FE80::/10\"\n    or \"FF00::/8\")\n","note":"## 调查指引\n\n### 规则说明\n经26端口向互联网发送SMTP\n\n### 为何重要\n建立外连、隧道或远控通道\n\n### 调查步骤\n1. 核对告警实体、进程/网络字段与时间窗。\n2. 核对是否符合变更窗口与已知业务工具。\n3. 关联同主机或同账号前后同类告警。\n\n### 常见误报\n- 合法变更窗口内的运维、发布或安全扫描\n\n### 响应建议\n1. 确认是否授权与变更窗口。\n2. 无授权则隔离相关主机或账号并排查落地与外连。\n3. 按主机与用户关联前后同类告警。\n","threat":[{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1071","name":"Application Layer Protocol","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1071/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1071.003","name":"Mail Protocols","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1071/003/"}]},{"id":"T1571","name":"Non-Standard Port","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1571/"}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0011","name":"Command and Control","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0011/"}},{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1048","name":"Exfiltration Over Alternative Protocol","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1048/"}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0010","name":"Exfiltration","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0010/"}}],"interval":"5m","related_integrations":[{"package":"network_traffic","version":"*"},{"package":"panw","version":"*"},{"package":"fortinet_fortigate","version":"*"},{"package":"pfsense","version":"*"},{"package":"zeek","version":"*"},{"package":"corelight","version":"*"}],"setup":"## 设置说明\n\n1. 接入边界或主机网络日志（Packetbeat、防火墙、云流量等，按规则数据源）。\n2. 确认相关数据流有数据后再评估告警。\n","investigation_fields":{"field_names":["@timestamp","source.ip","destination.ip","destination.port","network.protocol","network.direction","tls.server.x509.subject.common_name","dns.question.name","host.name","user.name","message"]},"version":115,"immutable":true,"rule_source":{"type":"external","is_customized":true,"customized_fields":[{"field_name":"name"},{"field_name":"description"},{"field_name":"note"},{"field_name":"setup"},{"field_name":"false_positives"},{"field_name":"tags"},{"field_name":"investigation_fields"}],"has_base_version":true},"actions":[],"exceptions_list":[],"risk_score_mapping":[],"severity_mapping":[],"required_fields":[],"output_index":"","revision":1,"enabled":true,"max_signals":100,"to":"now"}
